### 6. READING LISTS & FILTERED USER PROFILE
### ============================================================================

### 6.1 Add Blog B to User 1's reading list -> Expected: 201 Created (read defaults to false)
# @name addReadingList1
POST {{baseUrl}}/readinglists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{user1Id}},
  "blogId": {{createBlogUser1Second.response.body.id}}
}


### 6.2 Add Blog B to User 2's reading list -> Expected: 201 Created
# @name addReadingList2
POST {{baseUrl}}/readinglists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{user2Id}},
  "blogId": {{createBlogUser1Second.response.body.id}}
}


### 6.3 Missing userId or blogId -> Expected: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/readinglists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{user1Id}}
}


